  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WMC II: Increased Voice for Women in Political Processes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Women Make the Change II project (2025&#x2013;2028) is the second phase of a joint initiative by UN Women and UNDP aimed at increasing women&#x2019;s political representation and leadership in Papua New Guinea. The project seeks to ensure that by mid-2028, women are represented at the same or higher levels in political positions, legal and policy frameworks better enable women&#x2019;s participation and women&#x2019;s rights institutions and coalitions are strengthened to effectively represent women&#x2019;s voices in decisio</narrative>
  </description>
